// LIVE message: update nudge for anyone still on a pre-0.13 build.
// Supersedes 2026-07-24-update-0.12.jsonc, which was DELETED rather than kept:
// `lt 0.13` is a superset of `lt 0.12`, so keeping both would show a v0.11 user
// two "Update Available" dialogs back to back.
// Targeted `lt 0.13`, so it stops showing by itself the moment a user updates —
// no follow-up config change needed.
//
// OPTIONAL, and it stays optional: "Skip Update" plays the game they already
// have, on every launch, forever. This is a nudge, not a gate — nothing here
// blocks play, and no version is ever refused. Shown on EVERY launch rather
// than once because pre-0.13 builds lose the in-game UI panel backgrounds on
// some maps (LESSON-48) and never draw health bars, build-progress bars or
// build/reclaim particles (dead geometry-shader stage, LESSON-39); both hit
// every user, not just those who changed a setting. If that nagging ever needs
// softening, change `frequency`, not the Skip button.
//
// NB "Download Update" opens the releases page and QUITS — the user is going to
// install a new copy, so leaving the old one running is pointless.
//
// Wording follows the player-facing house style (MAINTENANCE.md): what they
// see, said once, no mechanism.
//
// GOES LIVE ONLY WHEN message-config/ IS PUSHED to the repo's main branch — the
// shipped launcher fetches it every launch. Do not push before v0.13 is
// published, or pre-0.13 users get pointed at a release that does not exist.
{
  "id": "update-0.13",
  "date": "2026-08-04",
  "target": { "op": "lt", "version": "0.13" },
  "title": "Update Available",
  "body": [
    "<p style='font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px'>",
    "A new version of BAR Launcher is available. Updating is optional — you ",
    "can keep playing on this one.",
    "</p>",
    "<p style='font-family:-apple-system;font-size:13px'>",
    "v0.13 fixes the in-game interface losing its panel backgrounds on some ",
    "maps, and brings back health bars, build-progress bars, and build and ",
    "reclaim particles.",
    "</p>"
  ],
  "frequency": "always",
  "buttons": [
    { "label": "Download Update", "action": "open-url", "url": "https://github.com/benbreen/RecoilEngine-AppleSilicon/releases/latest", "then": "quit", "default": true },
    { "label": "Skip Update", "action": "continue" }
  ]
}
